{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42807","headline":"到郡後有寄 · 刘兼","name":"到郡後有寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蜀路新修尽坦平，交亲深幸再逢迎。\n正当返袂思乡国，却似归家见弟兄。\n沾泽只慙尧綍重，泝流还喜范舟轻。\n欲将感恋裁书旨，多少渔笺写得成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42807.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42807","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}